  "title": "Top Downloaded Cancer Paper in 2023",
  "summary": "Our study in Nature’s Scientific Reports was the 17th most downloaded cancer paper in 2023! The study, “Shared hotspot mutations in oncogenes position dogs as an unparalleled comparative model for precision therapeutics” examined real-world clinical genomic data from 671 pet dogs with cancer treated by 200 veterinarians across the United States using the FidoCure platform. […]",
